# The ramp of testdata/topo/ramp.tlspr, its top's front edge and its edge
# along the slope picked on the turned view and rounded, meeting in an
# uneven mitre; the same as path_fillet_uneven.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalence/fillet_uneven).
file $testdata/topo/ramp.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
move 445 145
down L 445 145
up L 445 145
move 445 265
down L 445 265
up L 445 265
menu Features|Fillet Edges
